                </p>

                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3 hero-action-buttons mb-5">
                    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="TeklifAl" class="hero-btn-quote text-decoration-none" title="Hızlı ve Ücretsiz Fiyat Teklifi Alın">
